The following samples work with the chosen display. That is:

| :hwftlbl-scr:`LED(8×8)` : :dts:`chosen { zephyr,display = &led_strip_matrix; };`
| :hwftlbl-led:`RGB(8×8)` : :dts:`&led_strip_matrix { led-strip = <&led_strip>; };`

.. rubric:: LCD Orientation and Bit Order Test

Draw some basic rectangles onto the display using the
:external+zephyr:ref:`Display driver API <display_api>`.
See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`display`.

   .. rubric:: On ARM Cortex-M33

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/display
      :build-dir: waveshare_rp2350_matrix
      :board: waveshare_rp2350_matrix/rp2350a/m33
      :snippets: "usb-console"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

   .. rubric:: On Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/display
      :build-dir: waveshare_rp2350_matrix
      :board: waveshare_rp2350_matrix/rp2350a/hazard3
      :snippets: "usb-console"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

